# His words (2026-11-13), verbatim: "i also want a actual tool for irrational frequencies, and unconvential harmonic data, like dragging around to
#   create a nervous system response using poly vegal. like feelings or emotions as frequencies. make patterns from feelings." · "a full drag
#   on a tool and have it play the sounds like a four way grid. per song. look at all research into this, from all domains." · "i want love,
#   anger which is low irratating pitch, sadness, like hanging tree or bite the hand that feeds you." · "bite the hand hand that feeds you. a
#   song." · "no corners" · "all one feeling" · "no capture button or return" · "resize to add more dynamic range." · "then build it."
identity:
  id: eravos.feelings ; label: Feelings ; domain: music ; category: embodiment ; accent: "#7fb8ff"
  purpose: one feeling fills the pad; drag to play it. Up = more of the feeling; across = the feeling's own colour.
  claims: NONE — sound that carries a feeling; never described as treatment or as acting on anyone's nervous system.
assembles (components, tools/music/components/<id>/ — never re-implemented here):
  ratio-set
feelings (data in the engine: FEEL; the research: docs/research/feelings-as-sound.md):
  love     A3 register, pure partials (harmonic), soft onset 0.22 s, gentle vibrato; across = one pure voice → fuller, warmer, wider; up = louder (−34 → −5 dB), brighter, up to a fifth higher
  anger    A1 (55 Hz) growl: a saw an octave under + √2 partials, pressed (drive), loudness wobbling (roughness) — across = the wobble 30 → 150 Hz
           (Arnal 2015's irritation band); up = louder (−32 → −4 dB), harsher, brighter
  sadness  D2 heavy and dark, φ partials, detuned celeste, the pitch sagging and bending slowly; across = near and steady → far (wet 0.3 → 0.85),
           wide, more bend; up = louder (−36 → −7 dB), brighter, up from 5 semitones below
ports: out audio_out (stereo; compressor + soft ceiling ≤ 0.72) · in note_in (a note plays the feeling at that pitch, for its length) ·
  in transport_in · in mod: every knob — Across (x), Up (y), Speed, Pitch, Level (automate the feeling: a lane on x / y plays it with Hold on)
params: feeling love|anger|sadness · x · y · speed · harmonics auto|harmonic|φ golden|√2|√3|π/2|e/2|2^(1/φ)|golden stack|φ series|primes|stretched string|membrane · root −12…12 · hold · level
ui: the feeling picker and the pad (the whole window); a bigger window = a bigger pad. Nothing else on the face (his: "no capture button or
  return"); Hold, Harmonics, Pitch and Level on the tool page.
acceptance (feelings.test.js):
  - the tool contract (spawns clean, presets load in range, save → load exact, closing leaves nothing, Stop all obeyed)
  - silent until touched; touched sounds; let go fades to silence
  - up moves loudness ≥ 18 dB between bottom and top (the dynamic range)
  - anger's loudness wobble sits in 30–150 Hz and follows across; ≥ 6× love's
  - anger is low: its energy under 150 Hz ≥ love's × 4
  - a move while it sounds reaches it (y mid-note); peak ≤ 0.72 everywhere

